    "name": "GITT hold",
    "kind": "gitt",
    "description": "GITT with voltage hold: a sequence of current pulses (C/50) each followed by a 150-minute rest. The voltage is held for 6 h under potentiostatic control upon reaching the upper and lower voltage cutoffs. 5 cycles, room temperature.",
    "version": "1.0"
  },
